cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this package, please cite it as below (and the article it accompanies once published)."
type: software
title: "CatFORGE reproducibility package"
abstract: >-
  Code, data and stored results that regenerate every figure, table and number in the Results of the manuscript
  describing CatFORGE, a browser-based platform for data-guided, cost-aware catalyst design: the synthetic-data
  augmentation benchmark, the held-out predictor benchmark, SHAP explanations, cost-aware ranking and laboratory
  comparisons. Includes the evaluated versions of the platform's prediction, optimization and synthesis modules.
